#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:5
#: bf7da19e5862499aa90e35806a054844
msgid "CAN Bus Setup"
msgstr "CAN 总线设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:7
#: e5c6b4a9d85843418792d8712f7411f8
msgid ""
"This article shows how to setup CAN bus and what options users have to "
"accomplish the setup suitable for their specific needs."
msgstr "本文介绍如何设置 CAN 总线，以及用户有哪些选项来完成适合其特定需求的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:12
#: 080114423895436f8bc6d75abb87738d
msgid ""
"The :ref:`DroneCAN setup page is here <common-uavcan-setup-advanced>`. But "
"the parameters below must be configured correctly in order to use the "
"DroneCAN driver."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DroneCAN 设置页面在此 <common-uavcan-setup-advanced>`。但必须正确配置以下参数才能使用 "
"DroneCAN 驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:14
#: 6d5cf2edb4f04129bd2795febc926e8e
msgid "DroneCAN was formerly known as UAVCAN."
msgstr "DroneCAN 以前称为 UAVCAN。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:17
#: 8e37a9552b154338bffdafff08e9705d
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:19
#: fc7933ad95c9457697a76d3a6a3fed46
msgid ""
"A Controller Area Network (CAN bus) is a robust vehicle bus standard "
"designed to allow microcontrollers and devices to communicate with each "
"other in applications without a host computer. It is a message-based "
"protocol, designed originally for multiplex electrical wiring within "
"automobiles to save on copper, but is also used in many other contexts."
msgstr ""
"控制器局域网（CAN "
"总线）是一种强健的车辆总线标准，设计用于允许微控制器和设备在没有主机计算机的应用中相互通信。它是一种基于消息的协议，最初为汽车内部多路复用电气布线而设计（以节省铜线），但也在许多其他场合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:25
#: e8699dcec4e34bba88e63cc037b196dc
msgid ""
"All nodes are connected to each other through a two wire bus. The wires are "
"120 Ω nominal twisted pair."
msgstr "所有节点通过两线总线相互连接。导线为额定 120 Ω 双绞线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:28
#: b60214e6178d4a77ad048ae9663c3e17
msgid ""
"Most autopilots that run ArduPilot have either one or two CAN interfaces for"
" connection of different devices. ArduPilot can support up to 3 CAN "
"interfaces. The setup of the interfaces can be made in a way that will "
"provide redundancy or maximum throughput or a mix of both. This is "
"accomplished with a three layer approach, where apart from the physical "
"interface there exists a driver layer that represents a specific protocol "
"and a software layer (ArduPilot) that communicates on CAN bus through these "
"drivers."
msgstr ""
"大多数运行 ArduPilot 的飞控都有一个或两个 CAN 接口用于连接不同设备。ArduPilot 最多支持 3 个 CAN "
"接口。接口的设置可以提供冗余、最大吞吐量或两者的混合。这通过三层方法实现：除物理接口外，还有代表特定协议的驱动程序层，以及通过这些驱动程序在 CAN "
"总线上通信的软件层（ArduPilot）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:36
#: 8ba5486b9a34406e8cd42fc2194b50e4
msgid ""
"Each physical interface can be virtually connected to one of up to three "
"drivers that represent the protocols to be used. For example, the most "
"common scenario will be with all interfaces connected to a DroneCAN driver. "
"Such setup will provide redundancy for devices with up to three CAN "
"interfaces and full functionality for devices with one CAN interface."
msgstr ""
"每个物理接口可以虚拟连接到最多三个驱动程序之一，这些驱动程序代表要使用的协议。例如，最常见的情况是所有接口都连接到 DroneCAN "
"驱动程序。此设置将为具有最多三个 CAN 接口的设备提供冗余，并为具有一个 CAN 接口的设备提供完整功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:43
#: a4e31f7de539403884a2dcb217a94668
msgid "Configuration settings"
msgstr "配置设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:46
#: a83ea0d0fd4c4a618ef44ea0b645c794
msgid "Enabling CAN interfaces"
msgstr "启用 CAN 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:48
#: 4dc9adcdc2114584859e759298d88fa1
msgid ""
"Each physical port can be turned off or connected to corresponding driver "
"with parameter ``CAN_Px_DRIVER``, where x is the number of the CAN port. The"
" value of this parameter is the id of driver that will be associated with "
"this port (interface)."
msgstr ""
"每个物理端口可通过参数 ``CAN_Px_DRIVER`` 关闭或连接到相应驱动程序，其中 x 为 CAN "
"端口编号。该参数的值为将与此端口（接口）关联的驱动程序 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:53
#: fc11d0a11530443199dfcc534e8d82b2
msgid ""
"Each enabled bus/driver will use a block of RAM memory (not Flash) depending"
" on the type of driver and if CANFD is enabled. For example, DroneCAN will "
"allocate 12KB for its driver (24K if CANFD) by default, but can vary from "
"board to board depending on its defaults, if set by its hardware definition "
"file. The ``CAN_Dx_UC_POOL`` parameter can be used to change the pool size. "
"Required pool size depends on bus traffic required by the attached DroneCAN "
"peripheral and can sometimes be reduced for peripherals such as GPS or "
"Compass, whereas peripherals such as ESCs require more bus traffic and "
"therefore a larger pool size."
msgstr ""
"每个已启用的总线/驱动程序将根据驱动程序类型及是否启用 CANFD 使用一块 RAM 内存（非 Flash）。例如，DroneCAN "
"默认为其驱动程序分配 12KB（启用 CANFD 时为 24KB），但根据硬件定义文件的默认值可能因板卡而异。``CAN_Dx_UC_POOL`` "
"参数可用于更改内存池大小。所需内存池大小取决于所连接 DroneCAN 外设所需的总线流量，对于 GPS 或罗盘等外设有时可减少，而 ESC "
"等外设需要更多总线流量，因此需要更大的内存池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:55
#: ed21385820664c88b06b20b8159f390c
msgid ""
"For example, the most common setup will have one driver and all interfaces "
"will be connected to it. The :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` and "
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER<CAN_P2_DRIVER>` parameters in this configuration should "
"be set to 1 (first driver). And that driver ( "
":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>`) be set to 1 (DroneCAN)."
msgstr ""
"例如，最常见的设置是一个驱动程序，所有接口连接到该驱动程序。此配置中的 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` 和 "
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER<CAN_P2_DRIVER>` 参数应设为 "
"1（第一个驱动程序），该驱动程序（:ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>`）设为 1（DroneCAN）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:63
#: 413ae32edd9343ac97c4e6219a84ef24
msgid ""
"After change of any ``CAN_Px_DRIVER`` or ``CAN_Dx_PROTOCOL`` the autopilot "
"has to be rebooted for the changes to take place."
msgstr "更改任何 ``CAN_Px_DRIVER`` 或 ``CAN_Dx_PROTOCOL`` 后，飞控必须重启才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:66
#: 513b12fd77314e799fd0573725c031f1
msgid "Configuration of CAN interfaces"
msgstr "CAN 接口配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:68
#: 556309db1d7749a8b7b5a8f907c6d01d
msgid ""
"After enabling the interface and reboot two more parameters can be set for "
