#: ca94753b769e44fb81aeba60a851f815
msgid "``CAN_Px_DEBUG`` - allows output of debug messages"
msgstr "``CAN_Px_DEBUG`` — 允许输出调试消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:76
#: f01c86c394a34656baa4a6723dd5ea08
msgid ""
"Usually the bitrate used by default is 1 Mbit. Debug level can also be set "
"on user's preference and needs."
msgstr "通常默认使用的比特率为 1 Mbit。调试级别也可根据用户偏好和需要设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:82
#: faa5186480424ddd8378b4dee5da1bda
msgid ""
"When any of the interfaces are associated with any driver, that driver will "
"be loaded with specified protocol."
msgstr "当任何接口关联到任何驱动程序时，该驱动程序将以指定协议加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:86
