#: ../../source/docs/common-canbus-setup-advanced.rst:88
#: c44e5286feb344a893ca21213e9ca054
msgid ""
"The driver should be set to use some protocol. Currently there is support "
"for DroneCAN devices, which is numbered 1, and numerous CAN ESCs and other "
"devices. The parameter ``CAN_Dx_PROTOCOL``, where x is the number of driver,"
" should be filled with the number of protocol for this driver."
msgstr ""
"驱动程序应设置为使用某种协议。目前支持 DroneCAN 设备（编号为 1）以及众多 CAN ESC 和其他设备。参数 "
"``CAN_Dx_PROTOCOL`` （x 为驱动程序编号）应填入该驱动程序使用的协议编号。"

