#: ee3ef97dd79c4a0d87cf2eead997d2ce
msgid ""
"only devices matching the selected protocol can be connected to a given CAN "
"bus. Mixing of different protocol devices on a single CAN bus is not "
"allowed. However, if the Protocol is set to DroneCAN, certain devices with "
"different protocols can be attached. See :ref:`dronecan_mixed_protocols`."
msgstr ""
"只有与所选协议匹配的设备才能连接到给定的 CAN 总线。不允许在单个 CAN 总线上混用不同协议的设备。但如果协议设置为 "
"DroneCAN，则可以连接某些具有不同协议的设备。参见 :ref:`dronecan_mixed_protocols`。"

